      "text": "Immutability is the point: ransomware that reaches the subscription still cannot delete or rewrite these\ncopies, and the ledger anchor lets an examiner prove a receipt was never edited after the fact.",
      "originalText": "Immutability is the point: ransomware that reaches the subscription still cannot delete or rewrite these\ncopies, and the ledger anchor lets an examiner prove a receipt was never edited after the fact.",
